	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="de"><foreign xml:lang="la">Optimus et charissimus affinis meus <persName>Petrus Schär</persName> in non pridem datis ad <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>me amantissimis literis sic inter cętera scribebat:</foreign> "Gruͤtzt mir den <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>lieben herren m. <persName ref="p495">H. Bullinger</persName>; ich wellt so gern, das ich ime ain<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>mal ain dienst köndt thain, der inn fröwen möchte; wellt ich doch <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>warlich meinen lyb nitt sparen; dann er mir im hertzen lieb ist.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Ich hab euch zuͦ <placeName ref="l489">Stain</placeName> by maister <persName>Jergen Wympfern</persName> ain wintzler <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>käß verordnet, den esset von unsert wegen, und so ir maint, das es <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>nitt ain spott, so schribt ime noch um ain und schickt und schenkt <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>inn von meinen wegen dem herr <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName>."</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Ego vero, mi <lb xml:id="p1z10"/><persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, cum non dubitarem tibi, qui animum hic spectaturum esses, gra<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>tum fore hoc munus, advehendos curavi duos opimi illius lactis <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>caseos, qui Augustę quoque in praecipuis lauticiis habentur ita, ut bonus <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>hic <persName>Petrus</persName> meus illuc vectos magno distrahat.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Quorum alterum <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>nunc ad te mitto per hunc nostrum aurigam; qui si ad palatum et sto<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>machum tuum fecerit, nihil dubito te Petri nostri liberalitate pressi huius lactis <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>nunquam non copiam habiturum.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Praeterea non habeo, quod nunc scribam, <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>nisi quod mitto scriptum a <persName>Buflero</persName> ad me datum de puella ista, <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>quę nescio quibus malis artibus tot perspicacissimos oculos mirificis <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>praestigiis tot iam annis perstrinxit; puto autem ventrem ipsius <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>ex INTERIM centonibus suffartum hunc in modum tumuisse<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a">Hiezu a. R.: Ich gloub, es seyen lauter Interimsfezalumpen in diser metzen gewesen.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Certe de utroque recte dixeris: "Parturiunt montes"<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><hi>Horaz,</hi> poetica, 139.</note> etc.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Quid autem, obsecro, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>aliud sunt ventricosi istius monstri tumores quam id genus <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>ex variis rhapsodiis conflata fartura, quę dei se foetum impuden<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>tissime mentitur, id quod res ipsa facile docet, si quis factitium <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>hunc ventrem gladio spiritus, quod est verbum dei, prudenter dissecuerit; <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>ita nimirum alterum hoc virginis<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b">hoc virginis <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> monstrum alterius istius<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c">istius <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note> typum appositissime praetulit.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Quod utinam tandem intelligant monarchae nostri, et quotquot christianę <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>reipublicae gubernaculis admoti sunt, ne perpetuo tanto totius <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>orbis exitio dementari se sustineant.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Rem hanc vellem <lb xml:id="p1z31"/><persName ref="p8011">Gvaltherus</persName> noster sua nobis suavissime musa diligentius illustraret.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z32"/><placeName ref="l303">Magdeburgensium</placeName> obsidio 8. novembris die, si vera ex <placeName>Norico</placeName> scribuntur, <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>nondum soluta fuit; quam iam nihil dubito vel ista frigoris in<lb xml:id="p1z34"/>clementia solvit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Fortissimus suorum adsertor Iesus Christus et illos <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>et nos, quotquot sibi fidimus, de suis pariter et nostris hostibus <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>quamprimum vindicet regnique sui pomeria data sua pace <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>quam amplissime dilatet.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">In eo, mi frater, mi anime, bene <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>ac ęternum vale cum sanctissima tua familia omnibusque amicis et <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>fratribus, quorum iucundissimo conspectu atque colloquio dieculis aliquot <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>me oblectare omnino nuper animus erat, postquam <placeName ref="l49">Biele</placeName> rediissem; <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>sed non ita tulit itineris ratio, quandoquidem <placeName ref="l28">Basilea</placeName> <placeName>Rheinfelde<lb xml:id="p1z42"/>num</placeName> ad patruelem meum profectus sum, inde vero Pontum<note type="margin">a.R.: <placeName ref="l69">Brugg</placeName>!</note>, <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>postea recta huc mihi propter conductum in hoc servum proper<lb xml:id="p1z44"/>andum fuit.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Dabit vero dominus, ut commodius aliquo tempore <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>diutius ac felicius vos fruar in domino.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Sed en caseum, quem allatum putabam, nondum misit d. <persName>Wympferus</persName>; <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>mittam igitur, ubi primum accepero.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Iterum vale.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">27. novembris.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Tu ad me, obsecro, de comitiis vestris, et si quid aliud est, diligenter.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z4"/>Es ist des <persName>Buflers</persName> factor, der disen teutschen brieff geschickt hat.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/>Es solt mir der brieff langest zuͦkomen sin.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p495">Bullinger<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>o</persName> suo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
